\title{Bialy–Mironov：Integrable Billiards and Related Topics}
\date{2026-10-19}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Misha Bialy、Andrey E. Mironov，\em{Integrable Billiards and Related Topics}，载 \em{Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026, Volume 5: Invited Lectures (Sections 9–11)}，SIAM，2026，42–58 页；在线发表日期 2026-07-13。[正式全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/full/10.1137/25M1804078)，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1137/25M1804078)。}
\p{版权为 © 2026 International Mathematical Union，由 SIAM 按 [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 许可发布。本站专题为对报告的中文改编与分拆，补充了独立的初等推导，并明确保留所引研究定理的归属；文字、符号约定和组织结构均有改动。}
\p{报告第 1–2 节讨论可积性与经典台球，第 3 节讨论四个平面模型，第 4–5 节讨论有效刚性和有限对称，第 6 节讨论 Mather β 函数，第 7 节讨论磁性与 Minkowski 模型，第 8 节讨论线台球和锥，第 9 节列出开放问题。}
\p{补充定理与规范的版本来源：Stefano Baranzini、Misha Bialy、Alfonso Sorrentino，[Isoperimetric-type inequalities for Mather's β-function of convex billiards，arXiv:2509.06915v2](https://arxiv.org/html/2509.06915v2)，2025-12-22，尤其第 2–4 节；Alexey Glutsyuk，[On polynomially integrable Birkhoff billiards on surfaces of constant curvature，arXiv:1706.04030v7](https://arxiv.org/html/1706.04030v7)，2019-02-22，定义 1.1、定理 1.6、推论 1.7。}
\p{Luca Baracco、Olga Bernardi，[Totally integrable symplectic billiards are ellipses，arXiv:2305.19701v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2305.19701v1)，2023-05-31，定理 1.1；Luca Baracco、Olga Bernardi、Alessandra Nardi，[Bialy-Mironov type rigidity for centrally symmetric symplectic billiards，arXiv:2402.19154v1](https://arxiv.org/html/2402.19154v1)，2024-02-29，定理 1.1；Misha Bialy、Daniel Tsodikovich，[Locally maximizing orbits for the non-standard generating function of convex billiards and applications，arXiv:2203.15552v2](https://arxiv.org/html/2203.15552v2)，2022-05-30，命题 2.1。}
